  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Exportr&#xe5;det syftar till att utf&#xf6;ra en marknadsstudie; - faktabaserad analys av tillv&#xe4;xtm&#xf6;jligheter,  - en beskrivning av vilka aff&#xe4;rsm&#xf6;jligheter som finns f&#xf6;r svenska f&#xf6;retag samt hur de b&#xf6;r prioriteras,   - en gemensam agenda f&#xf6;r exportfr&#xe4;mjande inklusive prioriterade segment samt fr&#xe4;mjande program.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish Trade Council is to carry out a market study;  - Fact-based analysis of growth opportunities, - A description of the business opportunities for Swedish companies and how they should be prioritized;  - A common agenda for export including priority segments and promotion programs.</narrative>
